WEBVTT

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.580
Like they say, don’t resist arrest!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.170
Domyoji, you shouldn’t go charging in like that.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.590
Why not?

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.550
The Reds got our backs.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.680
Those guys act quickly,

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.890
so all we have to do is scatter the Greens,

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:46.190
and the Reds will handle the rest.

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:49.570
Tactically, it’s not wrong,

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:52.940
but we shouldn’t rely on the other clans too much...

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:59.870
Akiyama, bring the police vehicle around.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.160
Yeah, we got them all.

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:09.040
The Reds’ have their own network of resources

00:01:09.040 --> 00:01:13.090
to track down illegal activities
that our clan tends to overlook.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.970
It’s thanks to them that we were able to subdue these suspects so quickly.

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:19.720
It won’t hurt to show them some gratitude.

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:25.480
I admit, they have helped
drastically improve our patrol...

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:29.150
In the end, everything worked out just fine.

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:36.070
We’ll take the prisoners

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.030
Yeah.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:44.080
Oh, thanks!

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:48.000
We just put ‘em in that car?

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.460
Yes, please do that.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.380
Make sure they are tightly restrained.

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:54.090
All this buddy-buddy is making me sick...

00:03:36.440 --> 00:03:39.110
But why can’t I go in?!

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:41.610
Not now.

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:46.990
Meow?!

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.750
It’s the first time...

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.960
I’ve been in your room, Lieutenant.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.760
So this is where you lived all these years...

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.300
All alone.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.760
Guess what, Lieutenant...

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.770
My sister left us behind something amazing...

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.780
They dug it out from the shelter
remains next to my old research lab

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:28.700
several years after we went our separate ways.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:33.210
It was stored in a box and donated to the library

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:39.170
and stayed there until Kusanagi-san found it.

00:04:39.880 --> 00:04:42.670
You know, the Reds’ second in command.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:47.140
I think Sis knew this was going to happen...

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:53.060
How you’d stop at nothing to fulfill our dreams...

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:57.190
And how I’d stumble
once that dream became too big...

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:58.440
All of it...

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.380
“Irren ist menschlich.”
(“To err is human.”)

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.010
Shiro!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.390
Are you finished?

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.060
Yeah...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:35.940
There really were
no personal effects to go through...

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:48.030
Meow?!

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:54.750
I know the Lieutenant’s original order

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:58.540
was to assist me until I made my return to the surface.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:01.790
Sorry to make you guys extend that term for so long.

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.420
Such thoughtful words...

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:08.550
from the friend of our king.

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.390
In accordance with our king’s dying orders,

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:16.180
the Gold Clan Tokijikuin will engage solely in

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:19.690
the maintenance of the existing system,

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:23.900
and will now cease active participation in this affair.

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.190
I ask for your approval.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.240
Permission granted.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.200
And thank you...

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.540
For your years of service to Kokujoji Daikaku...

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.100
It’s somewhat unfortunate that

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:58.480
we cannot rely on the Gold Clan for military support.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:02.190
That group is not purely a fighting unit.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.270
They occupy an important position...

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.360
They <i>are</i> the upholders of the Slates.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:11.320
We can’t just recruit them carelessly
and risk losing them.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.660
Lieutenant knew that only too well.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:16.620
That’s why he made the condition to assist me

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:18.830
only until I came back down.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.250
So does that mean...

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:24.880
the one who manages the Slates
is that Blue King?

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:30.260
Don’t tell me you still have a grudge
on him from your last beating?

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.760
The boss with glasses goes flash!

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:36.220
Dodge! Step! Swoosh! Wham! Bam!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.260
“I’m over here.”

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:37.970
“What?!”

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:38.720
Achoo!

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:39.390
Bitch slap!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.440
Jab! Jab! Jab!

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.770
Kaboom!

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:45.690
“Ha, ha, ha, ha...”

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.110
And then...

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:54.740
Yup, he totally kicked your butt!

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:58.330
I-It’s nothing personal like that!

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.660
I mean!

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.210
So, as I explained...

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:09.510
Oversight of Mihashira Tower and the Dresden Slates

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:13.130
has been officially turned over to us, SCEPTER 4.

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:16.890
You should also be getting a letter
from the Gold Clan soon.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:22.890
So you get to act like king now that
His Excellency is gone, is that it?

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:25.480
Not “acting”.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.650
I was chosen by the Slates.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:32.320
Also, Gold Clan’s sole authority to issue orders

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:37.660
to each government agency will be transferred to us.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.660
That’s absurd! Just when...

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:44.000
“Just when the weight hanging
over my head is finally gone.”

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:45.170
Is that it?

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:48.880
Let me reassure you, Mr. Prime Minister.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:50.050
We have no intention of

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:54.800
controlling this country’s future
out of self-interest.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:58.550
At this time,
we are confronting the Green Clan,

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:01.430
which threatens the peace of our nation...

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:05.230
And I’m just going to request
cooperation from various quarters.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:07.190
That is all.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.940
You demand sole authority to issue orders...

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.190
and then call it “request”?

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:15.570
One must have a foundation to maintain order.

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:20.080
So, Mr. Prime Minister,
I “request” your cooperation as well.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:24.790
In other words, I have to obey you.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:27.000
If you put it that way, yes.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:39.390
It seems the partnership with the Blue Clan

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.560
is going better than expected.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:45.060
Uh-huh.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:58.820
Aw man, they’re so lucky.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.370
Say, Kusanagi-san...

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:03.870
Why do I have to be on standby?

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:07.080
We’re supposed to be pulverizing the Greens.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:08.710
HOMRA’s gonna look bad

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:10.880
without Yatagarasu joining the party, you know.

00:10:10.880 --> 00:10:13.250
You’re like the reserves.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:19.760
We need you around just in case
something goes wrong out there.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.810
So I’m a benchwarmer?

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.890
Don’t get all bent out of shape.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:31.150
Besides, aren’t you the one
who said you’d be protecting Anna?

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:33.900
Well yeah, but...

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:41.280
Yata-chan, you have to learn
to be an observer too.

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.950
This is a good chance for you.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:45.290
Fine!

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:56.550
The Green King has been pretty quiet

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:59.300
since the incident on school island.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:04.430
As usual, it’s only the low-rank clansmen who are acting up.

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:08.020
The Blues in public and the Reds
from behind the scenes...

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.980
As long as he’s being watched from both ends,

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:13.020
he can’t do anything drastic.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:14.690
Even so...

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:26.700
He’s not being pressured,
he’s just saving up his strength.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:33.210
So he’s sharpening his fangs...
before his next big move, eh?

00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:43.590
That makes me uneasy.

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.430
What’s there to fear?

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:48.930
We’ve got Anna,
and two other kings on our side!

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.850
Even if those green worms bring out their boss,

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.230
we can easily crush them!

00:11:59.110 --> 00:12:02.070
Even with three kings...

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:12.750
<i>Please tell the Red King to keep</i>
<i>an eye on the Blue King’s condition.</i>

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.420
<i>Condition? How so?</i>

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:19.800
<i>I can’t say for sure...</i>

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.130
<i>But he’s very unstable...</i>

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.260
<i>Almost like when...</i>

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:43.030
<i>The burden of killing a king?!</i>

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:47.990
<i>And it’s already starting to show...</i>

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.240
<i>You’ve noticed it too, right?</i>

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:53.750
<i>You mean... his Sword of Damocles?</i>

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:59.290
<i>It’s not like something’s going to</i>
<i>happen right away...</i>

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.010
<i>But we can’t ignore it either...</i>

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.510
<i>So it’s best to be on</i> <i>our highest alert.</i>

00:13:13.480 --> 00:13:16.100
There’s no guarantee
how much help we can count on...

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:22.070
I just wish we didn’t have to worry about
more casualties coming out of this whole mess.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:26.410
But I guess it’s not going to be that easy.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:29.200
It’s because of the Slates...

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:34.160
That I was able to meet Mikoto
and everyone in HOMRA.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:39.380
But if the Slates...

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:42.840
will continue to cause someone
to meet the same fate as Mikoto,

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.300
then I...

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.090
Anna, what’re you saying?

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:55.520
Is it that bad?

00:13:57.480 --> 00:13:58.940
I mean with the Blue King?

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:09.620
Time for battle!

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:10.200
Shiro?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.410
Show some respect.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:12.280
Just a moment...

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.200
Die!

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.330
Move onward!

00:14:14.330 --> 00:14:15.910
Huh?

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:18.170
Shiro?

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:21.590
Hey, Shiro!

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:25.420
Huh?

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:30.470
Say, where’s Shiro?

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:32.970
He stepped out a moment ago.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.010
Huh?!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.470
Where’d he go?!

00:14:35.470 --> 00:14:37.350
I want to go too!

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:40.230
Leave him be for now.

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:44.020
He probably wants some time alone
to think things over...

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:45.610
Aww!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.990
Just when I finally got to see him again...

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:09.010
This country will end unless we do something...

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:10.220
And fast...

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:17.560
It seems the Blue King has
decided to ignore your warnings.

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:20.060
And after all the trouble you went through.

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:21.270
I feel sorry for you.

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:24.400
I don’t appreciate being spied on...

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.650
Green King Hisui Nagare.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:30.780
My eyes are everywhere.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.530
It’s my only freedom.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:44.670
So you crawl out the moment Lieutenant dies...

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.300
I must say, you are quite the cunning person.

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:53.550
This coming from the man who decides to act

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.180
only after his best friend dies?

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.810
I find that ironic...

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:59.560
Ouch...

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:03.060
You’ve got me on that one.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.560
So?

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:06.150
Well...

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:09.320
Now that we’ve exchanged pleasantries...

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:11.450
Let’s move on to the main topic...

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:16.620
I’ve been waiting for your return...

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:20.080
So that I can give you this proposal...

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:28.960
First King Adolf K. Weismann,
the Silver King...

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:32.220
Would you like to team up with me?

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:38.180
I thought you came here to join
our Coffee Table Alliance,

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:42.140
so that the four of us can
work towards world peace.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.350
But it doesn’t sound that way.

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:46.810
Coffee Table Alliance?

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:50.400
I do respect the name you’ve given it...

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.360
But no, it’s certainly not that.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:56.410
I’m talking about forming
a new alliance, just you and me.

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.740
Together we will promote
the evolution of mankind...

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:04.120
That used to be your life’s goal, wasn’t it?

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:06.920
Back in Dresden, seventy years ago.

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.340
Those Slates...

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:14.800
are what makes us kings and our clansmen...

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:17.140
It is an evolution accelerator.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:19.140
But for decades,

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:22.600
the all-powerful Gold King has kept it under control...

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:25.270
As a result, the birth of Strains were minimal...

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:29.610
He even managed to contain the birth of kings within the Kanto area of Japan.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:31.650
This great power...

00:17:32.570 --> 00:17:34.780
We’ll release it.

00:17:34.780 --> 00:17:38.910
So that’s your goal, huh?

00:17:38.910 --> 00:17:40.160
For what purpose?

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.540
Like I said...

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:45.750
To promote the evolution of mankind.

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.540
That’s all.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:52.800
You’re even more dangerous than I thought.

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:56.340
I’ll take that as a compliment...

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.300
But...

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:01.310
That is my dream.

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:03.810
Your dream?

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.400
That dream...

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.900
...has been shattered?

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:16.150
Then rebuild that dream again... with me.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:20.950
The situation is different from seventy years ago.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:23.410
There’s nothing...

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.160
...to stop us.

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.670
All we have to do is act on it.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.640
I respectfully refuse!

00:18:44.640 --> 00:18:45.930
Why?

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:50.690
<i>Because everything is different</i>
<i>from seventy years ago!</i>

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:56.110
I thought you would like my proposal...

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:58.950
But I guess I was wrong.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:01.070
Well, no matter.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.450
I’ll be taking the Slates by force.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:08.370
The Blue King foolishly thinks
he can suppress the Slates power,

00:19:08.370 --> 00:19:10.670
just as the Gold King did.

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:14.800
So I was going to simply wait until
that rookie exhausted himself...

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:18.840
That was my original plan...

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:20.970
But this calls for a change of plans.

00:19:21.680 --> 00:19:26.140
<i>Now that I’m back, you won’t be
able to do whatever you please.</i>

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.100
I see...

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:32.060
I wanted to partner with you and move forward...

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:34.980
However, if you wish confrontation instead...

00:19:34.980 --> 00:19:39.490
I’m happy to oblige.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:47.700
Can I confirm one thing?

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.700
The incident a year ago...

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:53.130
Is it safe to assume that you were the one

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:55.750
who dragged me into this little game?

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:02.340
Oh, so you figured it out?

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:07.640
Not even the Blue Clan’s Yuishiki System

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.270
could identify this body...

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:14.650
Only you could have pulled off a stunt like that.

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:16.690
Which means...

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:20.650
The one who made all the arrangements for the Colorless King to take action...

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:22.070
The one who sent him to attack me...

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.530
Was none other than you!

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:33.920
I see...

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:36.790
Removing all trace of existence...

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:39.670
Making death look accidental...

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.470
Providing pivotal data...

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:47.050
All the things I took pains with... were my downfall.

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:50.100
I have a habit of being too elaborate.

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.480
Why do all of this just to get to me?

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:56.310
Because your role is not to be a spectator...

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:58.770
It’s to be a player.

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:01.490
After all, everything started with you.

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:04.360
Do you intend to control the Slates?

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.990
Or should I say... release them?

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.620
I guess you could say that.

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:17.580
So relax and entrust your dream to us.

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:22.210
And if I say... “No”?

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.350
If that’s what you want...

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:38.860
Then it’s war.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:09.760
I don’t want any of this...

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:13.140
But I won’t run away anymore.

00:23:57.700 --> 00:24:00.960
The three kings assemble before the tower.

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:04.210
The Green King arrives to destroy order.

00:24:04.210 --> 00:24:06.290
But we have not yet witnessed...

00:24:06.290 --> 00:24:09.460
The terrifying power
that will shake up everything...

00:24:10.420 --> 00:24:12.430
Those who must fight.

00:24:13.010 --> 00:24:15.140
Those who must defend.

00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:18.470
Next time on <i>K: Return of Kings,</i>

00:24:18.720 --> 00:24:21.480
#6 “Keeper”.

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:23.270
Mikoto...

00:24:23.270 --> 00:24:26.110
Do you think I can fulfill my role as King?
